  - id: the_temple_sermon
    displayName: The Temple Sermon
    flavorText: Standing in the gate of the LORD's house, Jeremiah warns Judah that
      chanting 'the temple of the LORD' three times over cannot save them from judgment.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Warns Judah that the temple building itself is no guarantee of safety
      \u2014 obedience, not the sanctuary's mere presence, is what God requires;
      delivered twice, once in chapter 7 and again, nearly costing Jeremiah his life,
      in chapter 26."
    deliveredByManagerId: jeremiah
    managerId: temple_sermon
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
