  - id: the_new_covenant
    displayName: The New Covenant
    flavorText: The LORD promises a new covenant in which his law is written not
      on tablets of stone but on the hearts of his people.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Promises a future covenant unlike the Sinai covenant Israel broke \u2014
      God's law written on the heart and sins remembered no more \u2014 the theological
      high point of the book's restoration oracles."
    deliveredByManagerId: jeremiah
