  - id: the_letter_to_the_exiles
    displayName: The Letter to the Exiles
    flavorText: Jeremiah writes to the exiles in Babylon, telling them to build houses
      and plant gardens and trust the LORD's plan of peace after seventy years.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Instructs the exiles to settle in for the long haul rather than trust
      the false prophets promising a swift return, grounding hope instead in a specific,
      dated promise of restoration.
    deliveredByManagerId: jeremiah
    managerId: letter_to_exiles
