  - id: the_oracles_against_the_nations
    displayName: The Oracles Against the Nations
    flavorText: Jeremiah carries the cup of the LORD's fury from nation to nation,
      pronouncing judgment on Egypt, Moab, Edom, and finally Babylon itself.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Extends Jeremiah's message beyond Judah in judgment oracles against
      Egypt, Philistia, Moab, Ammon, Edom, Damascus, Elam, and finally Babylon, establishing
      that the LORD's moral accountability is not limited to his own covenant people.
    deliveredByManagerId: jeremiah
